# Three Paths (mission.cop.three_paths#century_helper). Main (5-3 current, Louverance 8) and bob (5-3 current,
# Louverance 11, a helper) in Mine Shaft #2716, partied. Main enters Century of Hardship; bob enters. Won by bfwin (a
# GM): 32001 to both (the Century of Hardship's win); each finishes: Three Paths' Mine Shaft 32001 moves main's
# Louverance 8 to 9; bob's 11 stays.
lists MineShaft2716/_0d0/onTrigger MineShaft2716/onEventUpdate/32000 MineShaft2716/onEventFinish/32000 MineShaft2716/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=MineShaft2716 pos=-93.657,-120,-583.561 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
char bob zone=MineShaft2716 pos=-93.657,-120,-583.561 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Cop ThreePaths current
bob: mission Cop ThreePaths current
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
missionstatus Cop 8 pos=2               # a GM
bob: missionstatus Cop 11 pos=2         # a GM
trigger _0d0
update 32000 option=1
finish
bob: trigger _0d0
bob: update 32000 option=1
bob: finish
bfwin
finish
bob: finish
